# ⭐ RENUMBERED 2.14 -> 2.13, 17 Aug 2026 (old Fig 2.3 dropped; everything after shifts down one).
# ⚠ This figure NEVER had a Chow panel — see the note below on why a break panel was refused.
#   That decision now looks better than it did: under the one-rule selection this series prefers
